          "title": "You'll want to know: il bivio",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "il bivio — \"the fork (in a road)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Al bivio prendi la strada per il mare. At the fork take the road to the sea."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Figuratively, a crossroads in life: essere a un bivio."
            }
          ]
        },
