          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "bivio is a learned borrowing from Latin bivium 'a place where two roads meet', from bi- 'two' and via 'way' (Lewis & Short)."
            }
          ]
        },
